  "title": "Southland Announces Second Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "Southland Holdings, Inc. (NYSE American: SLND and SLND WS) (“Southland”), a leading provider of specialized infrastructure construction services, today announced financial results for the quarter ended June 30, 2026. Revenue of $113.3 million for the quarter ended June 30, 2026, compared to $215.4 million for the quarter ended June 30, 2025. Gross loss of $71.2 million for the quarter ended June 30, 2026, compared to $13.0 million in gross profit for the quarter ended ...",
